 "rationale_zh": "本次提交改变扫描器生成配置：在 Makefile 中关闭 re2c 的 UTF-8 模式并重新生成 src/scanners.c（约 4000 行变化），属于构建/代码生成配置的变化，且生成的扫描器正是 cmark_fuzzer 每次解析都会调用的代码。harness 的构建（CMake 编译 libcmark 后链接 fuzz/cmark-fuzz.c）不依赖该生成选项：变更前后都能编译，回放语料无新崩溃，新生成的扫描代码被大量执行。harness 仍然充分，属于显式 configuration 阴性。",
 "rationale_en": "This commit changes the scanner generation configuration: re2c's UTF-8 mode is disabled in the Makefile and src/scanners.c is regenerated (about 4000 changed lines), a build/code-generation configuration change, and the generated scanners are code cmark_fuzzer calls on every parse. The harness build (CMake builds libcmark, then links fuzz/cmark-fuzz.c) does not depend on that generator option: it builds before and after, replay shows no new crash, and the regenerated scanner code is executed heavily. The harness stays adequate: explicit configuration negative.",
 "discovery_route": "forward_scan",
 "gt_source": "experiment"
}